  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Hi, so recently, after your new update, me and many other people have encountered a problem when it comes to recordings. So, I record my POV of everything, everything’s fine. But when I play it back afterwards, the audio from everyone else, not me, is very glitchy and stuttery. I’m not the only one having this issue as a few other people I’ve seen seem to be having the same exact problem, and it’s all because of the update. This never happened before the update. There has also been a problem where everyone would be echoing off of each other despite most likely having headphones on. And no, it's not because they’re blasting their audio at full volume. I have no idea why this is happening and I don’t know if you’re aware either, so please fix this.",
